N2(v2) + H  => N2(v1) + H                          !   K_21_N2_H
N2(v1) + H  => N2(v2) + H                          !   4.9d-21 * exp(-(E_v2_N2-E_v1_N2)/(1.38064852d-23*Tgas*6.242d18))

